  (text "The Astronomy Files - Pin Mapping Summary:\n\n1. Real-Time Clock (I2C Bus):\n  - DS3231 Pin 5 (SDA) -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 8 (Pull-up 4.7k to 3.3V)\n  - DS3231 Pin 6 (SCL) -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 9 (Pull-up 4.7k to 3.3V)\n\n2. E-Paper Screen (SPI Bus):\n  - DISP1 BUSY -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 4\n  - DISP1 RST  -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 5\n  - DISP1 D/C  -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 6\n  - DISP1 CS   -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 7\n  - DISP1 SCLK -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 12\n  - DISP1 DIN  -> ESP32-S3 GPIO 11\n\n3. Power & Battery Management:\n  - TP4056 Battery Charger & AP2112K 3.3V LDO Regulator" 
